ICPC Live integration (added in Hydro XCPCIO Plus 0.8.0)
Source: https://github.com/icpc/live-v3/tree/v3.5.1
Commit: 200c82f81ffdea91ffec9cc17b314ffc72436a0f
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022-2023 ICPC Live Team, preserved in
licenses/ICPC-Live-MIT.txt and published as public/hydro-live/LICENSE.txt.
The overlay and admin frontends (src/frontend) are built from that commit with
live/frontend.patch applied: backend locations are read from the page Hydro
serves, overlay clocks follow the Hydro server's time, unsupported configuration
pages are removed, and the Monaco editor
(loaded from a CDN) is replaced by a plain text editor. scripts/build-live.mjs
reproduces live/dist; live/UPSTREAM.json records the source and patch hash.
The backend (src/backend, src/backend-api and the ICPC scoreboard, first-to-solve
and after-first-OK logic of src/cds/core) is ported to TypeScript in lib/live/,
reading Hydro contest data instead of a CDS feed; ranks, medals and first solves
use this plugin's shared Hydro rules instead of ICPC Live's tie-breaking. Title templates in live/media/
are copied unchanged from config/_media of the same commit.

